The purpose of the company is to provide technical consultancy services in Italy and abroad, more specifically: 
- consultancy activities for the management and control of the progress and risks of technological development programs;
- development and support of software for program management;
- preparation of technical and management documentation, including technical manuals.

Quantum Innovation (Quinn) is a Greek SME established in 2022, providing high-level consultancy for industries and research centers. Quinn provides services in Project and Proposal/Bid Management, Business Development, Market analysis, and System and Software Engineering in the European Union frameworks.

Quinn is providing high-level engineering and management consultancy in the space and defense markets.
The activities of Quinn are focussed on industrial projects covering added value services in the space market and Project Management support. 
Activities are carried out by Alessio Di Iorio, Managing Director and CEO with the support of a core team of highly skilled engineers and a network of professionals engaged time by time on a project basis. In 2022 the company counts XXXXXXX employess and collaborators.
Quinn operates in high-value, high-technology areas focusing on helping clients to exploit new technologies and management styles. 

Quinn provides solutions and services in:
&Oslash; System Engineering;
&Oslash; Mechanical design;
&Oslash; Thermo-Mechanical Engineering and Analysis;
&Oslash; Electrical/Electronic Engineering
&Oslash; Software Engineering;
&Oslash; Software Product Assurance and CADM;
&Oslash; Business Development;
&Oslash; Project and Proposal Management.
- The areas covered by Quinn are:
&Oslash; Ground Segment Check&ndash;out equipment (EGSE, MGSE) for satellite and payloads.
